@name     pattern_modulo
@alias    %
@group    seq
@c_name   skode_clause_pattern_modulo
@type     immediate
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  set active pattern step loop modulo
@doc
Sets loop length modulo for the active pattern.
Usage: % count (or pattern_modulo count)
@code
    return skode_exec_pct(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
